      "text": "<p>1. Boileau P., Bony Increased-offset Reversed Shoulder Arthroplasty Minimizing Scapular Impingement While Maximizing Glenoid Fixation. Clin Orthop Relat Res (2011) 469:2558–2567</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 27 2021 15:29:56 GMT+0000",
